## Verification summary

- Route guard: `canSeeAdmin(normalizeRole(role))` — non-admin roles (employee, contractor) render null.
- Organization panel: read-only display of `tenantName` and `documentLocale` from `getTenantSettings` query.
- No write mutation used for tenant document-locale (AM-3 compliance).
- My Profile panel: mounts existing `<LocaleSwitcher />` (one component, two mounts — §10).
- ErrorState: renders on fetch failure with retry callback.
- i18n: all user-visible strings via next-intl `settings` namespace; EN/ES/PT complete.

